	(descr "Castellated edge of the Snips XBee 3 carrier. Plated half holes at the coordinates of XBee_Carrier_Castellated on the V2 board, which mounts on V2's underside, so the carrier's XBee side faces away from V2 and these coordinates match that footprint directly. Outline is drawn on F.Fab; the board outline itself is on Edge.Cuts.")
